{"seq":2,"slug":"bounded-queues-buffers","title":"有界队列与缓冲管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/backpressure/bounded-queues-buffers","wordCount":1894,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"有界队列与缓冲管理\">有界队列与缓冲管理</h1><p>「我们加个队列削峰」——这句话在架构评审里几乎每次都出现，听起来无懈可击。但队列从来不是免费的削峰垫，它是一个用延迟换吞吐的装置，而且只有「有界」的队列才真正提供背压。一个无界队列不削峰，它只是把「立刻崩溃」推迟成「积累足够多以后再崩溃」。这一篇把队列的容量、延迟、抗突发三者之间的硬约束讲清楚，再看队列满了之后那个无法回避的决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>有界队列这一篇的核心概念围绕「容量这一条硬约束」展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有界才提供背压</strong>：无界队列不削峰，只是把「立刻崩溃」推迟成「积累够了再崩溃」，还制造排队几十秒的僵尸请求。</li>\n<li><strong>队列的「界」就是背压的「阀」</strong>：队列一旦达容量，系统被迫做出显式决策，这个决策点正是背压信号的产生处。</li>\n<li><strong>Little 定律</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>：把在途数、吞吐、延迟锁成铁三角，满载最坏延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = L_{max}/\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>容量靠反推</strong>：先定可容忍的最坏延迟，再乘以吞吐得出容量上限，而不是拍一个大数字。</li>\n<li><strong>四种溢出策略</strong>：拒绝、阻塞、丢队尾、丢队首，本质是背压四种应对在有界队列上的落地。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话串起来：<strong>队列是用延迟换吞吐的装置，只有有界才真正提供背压；容量不该凭感觉拍，而应由可容忍的最坏延迟反推得出</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么队列必须有界\">为什么队列必须有界</h2><p>无界队列是背压的头号杀手，原因在上一篇已点明（见 <a href=\"backpressure-principles\">背压原理与传播</a>）：它会默默吞掉所有过量请求，让上游感觉不到任何阻力，于是上游持续猛发，队列持续增长，直到内存耗尽 OOM。更隐蔽的危害是延迟：即便没 OOM，一个堆了几万条的队列意味着新进来的请求要排几十秒队才被处理，而此时客户端早已超时——服务器在为没人要的僵尸请求做功，这正是上一章拥塞崩溃的微观机制（见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-rate-limiting\">为何限流：过载与稳定性</a>）。</p>\n<p>有界队列把这个失控过程截断在一个明确的上限上。队列一旦达到容量，就必须做出一个显式决策——拒绝、阻塞、丢弃或降级——而这个「被迫决策」正是背压信号的产生点。换句话说，队列的「界」就是背压的「阀」。所以工程上的铁律是：永远不要用无界队列，包括默认无界的线程池任务队列（Java 的 <code>Executors.newFixedThreadPool</code> 内部用的就是无界 <code>LinkedBlockingQueue</code>，是经典的隐藏雷区）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"little-定律-容量-延迟-吞吐的铁三角\">Little 定律：容量、延迟、吞吐的铁三角</h2><p>队列里有一条不可违背的守恒律——Little 定律。它说在稳态下，系统中的平均在途请求数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、平均到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、平均逗留时间（含排队 + 处理）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条简洁的公式把队列设计的三个旋钮锁死成一个三角。假设你设了一个最多容纳 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个在途请求的有界队列，服务处理能力（吞吐）是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，那么队列满载时的最坏排队延迟就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = L_{max} / \\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>。这意味着队列容量不能凭感觉拍——它直接决定了你能给客户端承诺的最坏延迟。</p>\n<p>举个具体的例子：某服务稳定吞吐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> req/s，你希望最坏排队延迟不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = 200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> ms = 0.2 s，那么队列容量应设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{max} = \\lambda \\cdot W = 1000 \\times 0.2 = 200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>。把队列设成 10000 看似「更能扛」，实则把最坏延迟放大到 10 秒——远超任何客户端超时，等于把队列变成了僵尸请求的垃圾场。下表展示同一吞吐下，队列容量如何决定最坏延迟。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>吞吐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>队列容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>最坏排队延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = L_{max}/\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>评价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1000 req/s</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>50 ms</td>\n<td>抗突发弱，但延迟优秀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1000 req/s</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>200 ms</td>\n<td>平衡点，常见选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1000 req/s</td>\n<td>1000</td>\n<td>1 s</td>\n<td>延迟偏高，临界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1000 req/s</td>\n<td>10000</td>\n<td>10 s</td>\n<td>几乎全是僵尸请求，错误设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>队列容量的正确设法是「反推」：先定你能容忍的最坏延迟，再乘以吞吐，得出容量上限</strong>——而不是先拍一个大数字。这也呼应了上一篇缓冲策略的代价（缓冲增加延迟）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"队列满了-四种溢出策略\">队列满了：四种溢出策略</h2><p>队列设了界，「满了怎么办」就成了必须正面回答的设计题。这四种溢出策略，本质上是上一篇四种背压应对（见 <a href=\"backpressure-principles\">背压原理与传播</a>）在队列这个具体载体上的落地。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  ENQ[新请求尝试入队] --&gt; FULL{队列已满?}&#10;  FULL --&gt;|否| OK[入队成功]&#10;  FULL --&gt;|是| POLICY{溢出策略}&#10;  POLICY --&gt;|拒绝| REJ[返回 429/503&lt;br/&gt;把背压传给上游]&#10;  POLICY --&gt;|阻塞| BLK[调用方挂起等待&lt;br/&gt;反压到更上游]&#10;  POLICY --&gt;|丢队尾| DT[丢弃最新请求&lt;br/&gt;保住已排队的]&#10;  POLICY --&gt;|丢队首| DH[丢弃最旧请求&lt;br/&gt;偏好新鲜数据]\">flowchart TD\n  ENQ[新请求尝试入队] --&gt; FULL{队列已满?}\n  FULL --&gt;|否| OK[入队成功]\n  FULL --&gt;|是| POLICY{溢出策略}\n  POLICY --&gt;|拒绝| REJ[返回 429/503&lt;br/&gt;把背压传给上游]\n  POLICY --&gt;|阻塞| BLK[调用方挂起等待&lt;br/&gt;反压到更上游]\n  POLICY --&gt;|丢队尾| DT[丢弃最新请求&lt;br/&gt;保住已排队的]\n  POLICY --&gt;|丢队首| DH[丢弃最旧请求&lt;br/&gt;偏好新鲜数据]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>拒绝（reject / abort）</strong>：直接返回 429 或 503，让调用方知道被限了。这是最干脆、把背压信号传得最清楚的策略，适合同步请求。</li>\n<li><strong>阻塞（block / caller-runs）</strong>：让提交者挂起等待，或干脆让提交者自己执行这个任务（Java 的 <code>CallerRunsPolicy</code>）。它把压力反压到更上游，但会占用上游线程。</li>\n<li><strong>丢队尾（drop newest）</strong>：丢弃刚来的请求，保住已经排队的。适合「先到先得」语义。</li>\n<li><strong>丢队首（drop oldest）</strong>：丢弃队列里最旧的请求，给新请求腾位。适合「数据越新越有价值」的场景，比如实时行情、最新指标——旧的反正也快超时了。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选哪个取决于业务语义：可靠送达的请求选拒绝或阻塞（绝不静默丢），可丢的遥测选丢弃，新鲜度优先的选丢队首。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多队列与优先级缓冲\">多队列与优先级缓冲</h2><p>单一队列对所有请求一视同仁，但真实系统里请求有贵贱之分：用户的支付请求和后台的报表生成不该挤在同一条队里。一种常见做法是分级队列——为不同优先级开独立的有界队列，调度器优先消费高优先级队列，过载时优先丢弃低优先级队列。这既是缓冲管理，也是负载卸载的雏形（完整形态见 <a href=\"../distributed/load-shedding-priority\">负载卸载与优先级</a>）。</p>\n<p>另一个相关概念是隔板（bulkhead）：与其让所有下游调用共用一个大队列/线程池，不如按下游切分成多个小池，每个池有独立的有界队列。这样某个下游变慢只会填满它自己那个小队列，不会把整个服务的资源耗尽。隔板本质上是「按故障域切分缓冲」，它的设计与熔断、超时配套，详见 <a href=\"../practice/circuit-breaker-bulkhead\">熔断、隔板与超时</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>队列必须有界：无界队列不削峰，只是把崩溃推迟并制造僵尸请求；要警惕默认无界的线程池任务队列。</li>\n<li>Little 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 把容量、吞吐、延迟锁成铁三角；队列容量应由「可容忍的最坏延迟 × 吞吐」反推得出，而非拍脑袋设大数。</li>\n<li>队列满时有拒绝、阻塞、丢队尾、丢队首四种溢出策略，对应上一篇的四种背压应对，按业务语义（可靠性 vs 新鲜度）选择。</li>\n<li>分级队列与隔板把单一缓冲按优先级或故障域切分，是负载卸载（见 <a href=\"../distributed/load-shedding-priority\">负载卸载与优先级</a>）与故障隔离（见 <a href=\"../practice/circuit-breaker-bulkhead\">熔断、隔板与超时</a>）的基础。</li>\n<li>有界队列是命令式背压的载体；其声明式、标准化的对应物是响应式流的拉模型，见 <a href=\"reactive-flow-control\">响应式流与拉模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"有界队列与缓冲管理","id":"有界队列与缓冲管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么队列必须有界","id":"为什么队列必须有界"},{"level":2,"text":"Little 定律：容量、延迟、吞吐的铁三角","id":"little-定律-容量-延迟-吞吐的铁三角"},{"level":2,"text":"队列满了：四种溢出策略","id":"队列满了-四种溢出策略"},{"level":2,"text":"多队列与优先级缓冲","id":"多队列与优先级缓冲"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"背压原理与传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/backpressure/backpressure-principles"},"next":{"title":"响应式流与拉模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/backpressure/reactive-flow-control"}}